Plot     : Following his pursuit by Kirill,[b] Jason Bourne evades Moscow 
police while wounded and deals with more flashbacks of when he first joined 
Operation Treadstone, seemingly of him being forced to comply with the program. 
Six weeks later, CIA Deputy Director Pamela Landy reveals the audiotaped 
confession of Ward Abbott, the late former head of Treadstone, to Director 
Ezra Kramer. Meanwhile, in Turin, journalist Simon Ross of The Guardian 
has been writing a column on Bourne. He learns about Operation Blackbriar, 
the program succeeding Treadstone.
